{
  "name": "Weekly B2B Podcast Host Email Outreach (Apify -> Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Podcast Guest & Sponsor Outreach (Apify -> Google Sheets)\n\nAutomatically discovers active podcasts every Monday, filters out Anchor/Spotify proxy emails, deduplicates shows across keywords, drafts a personalized pitch subject & opener, and upserts unique rows into Google Sheets.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Set `APIFY_TOKEN` in n8n Environment Variables (Apify's free $5/month credit covers testing).\n- Connect a Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Schedule & Niche Config\n\nEdit **Configure Niche Search** to change target podcast keywords, country (`US`, `GB`, `CA`), publishing freshness (`activeWithinDays`), or your `pitchTopic` and `pitchSenderName`.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-config",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 1 Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Scrape & Clean Host Contacts\n\nCalls **67-labs/podcast-search-scraper** on Apify, drops any rows without a valid `hostEmail`, and deduplicates by `podcastId` so multi-keyword runs never double-pitch a show.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-extract",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 2 Extract & Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3: Draft Pitch & Upsert Sheet\n\nBuilds clean outreach columns (`outreachSubject`, `outreachOpener`) and upserts each podcast into Google Sheets matched by `podcastId` so weekly runs never create duplicate rows.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-sheets",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 3 Draft & Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-weekly",
      "name": "Weekly Monday Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-queries",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "={{ [\"B2B SaaS\", \"startup founders\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-country",
              "name": "country",
              "value": "US",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-max",
              "name": "maxPodcasts",
              "value": 50,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-days",
              "name": "activeWithinDays",
              "value": 60,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-sender",
              "name": "pitchSenderName",
              "value": "Your Name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-topic",
              "name": "pitchTopic",
              "value": "B2B SaaS growth",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "configure-search",
      "name": "Configure Niche Search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/67-labs~podcast-search-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $env.APIFY_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ queries: $json.queries, country: $json.country, maxPodcasts: $json.maxPodcasts, episodesPerPodcast: 0, activeWithinDays: $json.activeWithinDays, onlyWithEmail: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-podcast",
      "name": "Search Podcasts & Host Emails (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-not-empty",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hostEmail || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-has-at",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hostEmail || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "@",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-email",
      "name": "Filter Valid Host Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [940, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": {
          "fields": [
            {
              "fieldName": "podcastId"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dedupe-podcast",
      "name": "Deduplicate by Podcast ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1160, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "out-id",
              "name": "podcastId",
              "value": "={{ $json.podcastId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-name",
              "name": "podcastName",
              "value": "={{ $json.podcastName || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-owner",
              "name": "ownerName",
              "value": "={{ $json.ownerName || $json.artist || 'Podcast Team' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-email",
              "name": "hostEmail",
              "value": "={{ $json.hostEmail }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-src",
              "name": "hostEmailSource",
              "value": "={{ $json.hostEmailSource || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-web",
              "name": "website",
              "value": "={{ $json.website || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-genre",
              "name": "primaryGenre",
              "value": "={{ $json.primaryGenre || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-cadence",
              "name": "averageDaysBetweenEpisodes",
              "value": "={{ $json.averageDaysBetweenEpisodes ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-last",
              "name": "lastEpisodeDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.lastEpisodeDate || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-socials",
              "name": "socialLinks",
              "value": "={{ Array.isArray($json.socialLinks) ? $json.socialLinks.join(', ') : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-url",
              "name": "podcastUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.podcastUrl || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-subject",
              "name": "outreachSubject",
              "value": "={{ 'Guest pitch for ' + ($json.podcastName || 'your podcast') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-opener",
              "name": "outreachOpener",
              "value": "={{ 'Hi ' + ($json.ownerName || $json.artist || 'there') + ', I have been following ' + ($json.podcastName || 'your show') + ' and would love to share practical lessons on ' + $('Configure Niche Search').item.json.pitchTopic + ' — ' + $('Configure Niche Search').item.json.pitchSenderName }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-scraped",
              "name": "scrapedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.scrapedAt || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-lead",
      "name": "Format Lead & Pitch Draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1380, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": ["podcastId"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Leads to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1600, 320]
    }
  ],
